sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant Adapter as HTTP or ACP Adapter
    participant Store as Durable Session Store
    participant Kernel as Agent Kernel
    participant Provider
    participant Safety as Tool Safety Pipeline
    participant Observer as Durable Run Observer
    participant Evidence as Evidence and Receipt

    Client->>Adapter: Create, load, resume, or fork
    Adapter->>Adapter: Validate opaque ID and workspace boundary
    Adapter->>Store: Load exact revision or apply lifecycle transition
    alt Invalid, corrupt, stale, or reconciliation-required
        Store-->>Adapter: Typed session error
        Adapter-->>Client: Fail before provider call
    else Exact active snapshot
        Store-->>Adapter: Snapshot and revision
        Adapter->>Observer: Bind session, run ID, and revision
        Adapter->>Kernel: Canonical history, policy, and synchronous journal

        loop Bounded kernel iterations
            Kernel->>Provider: Profile-adapted request
            Provider-->>Kernel: Canonical bounded stream
            Kernel-->>Observer: Bounded assistant text
            opt Response contains tool calls
                Kernel->>Safety: Validate schema, permission, approval, sandbox
                alt Authorization, identity, or proof fails
                    Safety-->>Kernel: Typed denied result
                else Authorized immutable call
                    Safety->>Adapter: Journal ID, name, input digest, and run ID
                    Adapter->>Store: Mark first or exact-CAS update aggregate marker
                    alt Journal persistence fails or revision is stale
                        Store-->>Adapter: Typed persistence or CAS error
                        Adapter-->>Safety: Content-free journal failure
                        Safety-->>Kernel: Fail before start event and executor
                    else Write-ahead marker is durable
                        Store-->>Adapter: Guarded revision and exact marker
                        Adapter-->>Safety: Journal acknowledged
                        Safety-->>Observer: tool_execution_start after durable write
                        Safety->>Safety: Execute inside selected isolation
                        Safety-->>Kernel: Typed result or execution error
                        Kernel-->>Observer: Bounded redacted tool result
                    end
                end
            end
        end

        alt Successful terminal
            Kernel-->>Observer: completed terminal and evidence state
            Observer->>Observer: Freeze ordered transcript and latest marker
            alt Run has a journal marker
                Adapter->>Store: CommitInterruptedRun with revision and exact marker
                Note over Adapter,Store: One CAS commits transcript and terminal and clears lifecycle marker
            else No tool execution began
                Adapter->>Store: SaveExpected transcript and terminal
            end
            alt Commit succeeds
                Store-->>Adapter: Active session at new revision
                Kernel->>Evidence: Redacted evidence and artifact digests
                Adapter-->>Client: Durable revision before success
            else Commit fails
                Store-->>Adapter: Typed persistence or CAS error
                Adapter->>Adapter: Quarantine runtime; durable marker remains when present
                Adapter-->>Client: Typed durable session error
            end
        else Cancel, failure, disconnect, or process hard-exit
            opt Process remains alive for graceful finalization
                Observer->>Adapter: Applied or may-have-applied aggregate marker
                Adapter->>Store: Exact-CAS enrich current run marker
            end
            Note over Store: Hard exit skips terminal commit; the write-ahead marker remains on disk
            Adapter-->>Client: Failure when transport remains
        end
    end

    Client->>Adapter: Fresh-process load or resume
    Adapter->>Store: Read durable lifecycle
    Store-->>Adapter: Reconciliation required with digest-only marker
    Adapter-->>Client: Block before provider call
    Client->>Adapter: Explicit reconciliation at exact revision
    Adapter->>Store: MarkReconciled
    Store-->>Adapter: Active session at new revision
    Adapter-->>Client: Continuation may start without replay
